  "title": "Video moved from API preview into chat",
  "summary": "Video became part of the everyday workflow while model choices, API paths, and the community directory got easier to navigate.\n\nPreview MP4 generation arrived with Veo 3.1 Fast and Seedance, followed by `/video` in community chat with model selection and in-conversation playback. Seedance image-to-video requests were corrected, and the final model choices distinguish `seedance` Lite from `seedance-pro` Pro-Fast. Pricing displays now use video tokens for Seedance.\n\n`seedream` now selects Seedream 4.0, while `seedream-pro` selects 4.5 with 4K and multi-image support. Reference-image handling and small-request sizing were improved, and GPT Image image-to-image requests were fixed to use the image-editing endpoint.\n\nThirty-three projects joined the listings across the week, from terminal chat and PDF-to-speech to creative tools, games, and Flux AI. A new submission form and AI-assisted review path make it easier to propose an app and supply more information when needed.\n\nThe `gen.pollinations.ai` gateway added `/image/*`, `/text/*`, OpenAI-compatible `/v1/*` paths, and a `/models` shortcut. Documentation now uses those paths and explains text-generation query parameters. Amazon Nova Micro also joined the text lineup as `nova-micro`, with conversation and tool support.",
